**Retrospective:** Reused `bar_with_noise_ceiling` instead of writing a near-duplicate "grouped
bar" function for the Letters-vs-No-Letters comparison — the "two named series per level" shape
was already exactly what that function did; it only needed its hardcoded Model/Noise-ceiling
labels and colors turned into parameters.
